[D Library books tier 10 (Friend of the Library) and the Cozy Sleeping Bag chain in one running loop from the Stormwind Mage Tower, about 3.5 hours instead of about 5 for the two guides on their own. The sleeping bag gives up to 3% bonus experience. Needs level 18 for the books; the road runs through level 25-40 zones and Horde guards, so level 20-25 is the sensible start. Flight points and the hearthstone are optional. \\ The sleeping bag objects only work in order: Westfall, Barrens, Stonetalon, Loch Modan, Thoradin's Wall. \\ https://github.com/JanRK/Guidelime_DungeonQuests]
[GA Alliance]
[N 20 Library Books Alliance Tier 10 Cozy Sleeping Bag]

Talk to Garion Wendell in the Mage Tower and accept [QA78150 Friend of the Library] [G48.9,86.5 Stormwind City]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Stormwind] flight path [G71.6,72.3 Stormwind City] (hub: flies to every Alliance point in the Eastern Kingdoms)
Run out the gate and west through Elwynn to Westfall [G32,49.6 Elwynn Forest][G38,58 Elwynn Forest][G42.1,65.9 Elwynn Forest][G33,71 Elwynn Forest][G24.5,74.5 Elwynn Forest]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Sentinel Hill] flight path [G56.6,52.7 Westfall]
Search the Burned-Out Remains at the Alexston Farmstead wreckage and accept [QA79008 ... and that note you found] [G62,49 Westfall][G56,50 Westfall][G37.4,50.7 Westfall] \\ The Barrens remains do nothing until you have this note.
Loot *Bewitchments and Glamours* in the Dagger Hills, accept [QA78142] [G52,62 Westfall][G45.4,70.4 Westfall] \\ Vultros (elite) flies over central Westfall, Foe Reaper 4000 (elite) walks the fields near 44,35 and Leprithus (elite) rises at night near 42,29: watch for them.
Loot *Rumi of Gnomeregan: The Collected Works* in Sentinel Hill, accept [QA79093] [G52,62 Westfall][G52.7,53.8 Westfall]
Run back east over the bridge into Elwynn [G56,50 Westfall][G62,49 Westfall]
Loot *Archmage Theocritus' Research Journal*, accept [QA79092] [G24.5,74.5 Elwynn Forest][G33,71 Elwynn Forest][G42.1,65.9 Elwynn Forest][G52,66 Elwynn Forest][G62,67.5 Elwynn Forest][G65.4,70.1 Elwynn Forest]
Run back to Stormwind and the Deeprun Tram in the Dwarven District [G62,67.5 Elwynn Forest][G52,66 Elwynn Forest][G42.1,65.9 Elwynn Forest][G38,58 Elwynn Forest][G32,49.6 Elwynn Forest][G72,27.6 Stormwind City]
Ride the tram to Ironforge [G84.1,53.1 Ironforge]
[OC]Optional: get the [P Ironforge] flight path [G55.9,47.9 Ironforge] (hub: flies to every Alliance point in the Eastern Kingdoms)
Loot *Archmage Antonidas: The Unabridged Autobiography*, accept [QA79091] [G62,30 Ironforge][G76,10.4 Ironforge]

Leave Ironforge and follow the Dun Morogh road east through North Gate Pass into Loch Modan [G62,30 Ironforge][G53.6,33.9 Dun Morogh][G65.5,51.3 Dun Morogh][G84.1,33.8 Dun Morogh][G20.7,17.5 Loch Modan][G26.3,22.5 Loch Modan]
