Run north through Dun Algaz and follow the Wetlands road to Menethil Harbor [G25.5,11.5 Loch Modan][G55.1,73.7 Wetlands][G57,49.5 Wetlands][G49.7,26 Wetlands][G39.2,35.1 Wetlands][G33.6,47.9 Wetlands][G22.4,48.7 Wetlands][G12.3,52.2 Wetlands] \\ The Loch Modan figurine does nothing yet: you come back for it. Wetlands mobs reach level 25-30: stick to the road. Dark Iron elites hold Dun Modr west of the road near Thandol Span.
