Follow the Barrens road north past Ratchet, then south-west past Camp Taurajo to the burnt tower [G62.8,53.6 The Barrens][G62.9,48 The Barrens][G62.7,39.7 The Barrens][G59,34 The Barrens][G55.5,38.6 The Barrens][G52,43.8 The Barrens][G50.4,49.8 The Barrens][G47.5,58 The Barrens][G45.5,66 The Barrens] \\ Camp Taurajo has Horde guards: keep east of it.
