Run up the east side of Stonetalon and loot *Fury of the Land*, accept [QA78149] [G74.4,85.7 Stonetalon Mountains] \\ Grimtotem camps lie off the road: stick to it.
Run back through the pass into the Barrens [G82,96 Stonetalon Mountains]
Run north past the Crossroads and loot *Arcanic Systems Manual*, accept [QA78145] [G35.5,27.5 The Barrens][G43,31 The Barrens][G51,20 The Barrens][G56.3,8.8 The Barrens] \\ Razormane elites (Berserker, Flesheater, level 18-19) roam the north road: watch for them. Keep clear of the Crossroads guards.
Loot *Baxtan: On Destructive Magics*, accept [QA79097] [G51,20 The Barrens][G56,31 The Barrens][G59,34 The Barrens][G62.7,36.3 The Barrens] \\ Bruuz (elite, 20) patrols near the book.
Run south along the Barrens road and east through Dustwallow to Theramore [G59,34 The Barrens][G62.7,39.7 The Barrens][G62.9,48 The Barrens][G62.8,53.6 The Barrens][G53.5,10.7 Dustwallow Marsh][G57.2,20.8 Dustwallow Marsh][G61.3,27 Dustwallow Marsh][G63.5,38 Dustwallow Marsh][G66.8,48 Dustwallow Marsh][G71.7,56.7 Dustwallow Marsh]

Take the boat to Menethil Harbor [G4.7,63.8 Wetlands]
Follow the Wetlands road east and south to Dun Algaz [G12.3,52.2 Wetlands][G22.4,48.7 Wetlands][G33.6,47.9 Wetlands][G39.2,35.1 Wetlands][G49.7,26 Wetlands][G57,49.5 Wetlands][G55.1,73.7 Wetlands]
Go through Dun Algaz and run north-east along the north shore onto the Stonewrought Dam [G25.5,11.5 Loch Modan][G26.3,22.5 Loch Modan][G39.2,15.1 Loch Modan][G43.6,10.8 Loch Modan][G47.9,12.1 Loch Modan]
