Run back to Dun Algaz and north through the Wetlands to Thandol Span [G47.9,12.1 Loch Modan][G43.6,10.8 Loch Modan][G39.2,15.1 Loch Modan][G26.3,22.5 Loch Modan][G25.5,11.5 Loch Modan][G55.1,73.7 Wetlands][G57,49.5 Wetlands][G49.7,26 Wetlands][G51.3,10.1 Wetlands] \\ Dark Iron elites hold Dun Modr west of the road near the bridge: keep east.
