Cross Thandol Span and follow the Arathi road north and west to Thoradin's Wall, through the gate into Hillsbrad [G49.2,97 Arathi Highlands][G57.6,83 Arathi Highlands][G67.8,73.6 Arathi Highlands][G56.6,61.8 Arathi Highlands][G45.2,58.4 Arathi Highlands][G26.3,50.1 Arathi Highlands][G20.5,30.5 Arathi Highlands][G83.7,60 Hillsbrad Foothills] \\ Witherbark elites roam the east: keep to the road. Hammerfall (Horde guards) is far north-east: do not go there.
